source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A backslash before `h` keeps the line a paragraph and stays visible, because `h` is not escapable.
-- input.jira --
\h1. x
-- rendered.html --
<p>\h1. x</p>
-- want.md --
\\h1. x
